WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.625 --> 00:00:01.667
(bird screeches)

00:00:02.041 --> 00:00:03.083
 MAN:
&lt;font color = #FFFFFF&gt;&lt;i&gt;Kingdoms will fall.&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;

00:00:03.959 --> 00:00:05.000
##

00:00:05.917 --> 00:00:06.959
 -(screeching)
&lt;font color = #FFFFFF&gt;&lt;i&gt;-Heroes will rise.&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:10.208
&lt;font color = #FFFFFF&gt;&lt;i&gt;And a great warrior&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;
&lt;i&gt;shall emerge...&lt;/i&gt;

00:00:12.750 --> 00:00:13.792
&lt;font color = #FFFFFF&gt;&lt;i&gt;armed only with his courage&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;

00:00:15.458 --> 00:00:16.500
&lt;font color = #FFFFFF&gt;&lt;i&gt;and his weapon of war.&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;

00:00:17.875 --> 00:00:19.083
-Ah! Poppy! Come on!
-(bell rings)

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:22.208
You gotta keep the wing level,
otherwise its gonna look fake!

00:00:22.125 --> 00:00:23.333
I'm not an animatronic expert,
Ian.

00:00:24.458 --> 00:00:26.667
I'm a game programmer.
I shouldn't be doing
any of this.

00:00:26.375 --> 00:00:27.792
Well, you can thank David
for that.

00:00:27.834 --> 00:00:29.417
He's the one that wanted
to save money.

00:00:29.542 --> 00:00:32.125
No. No. I just didn't want
to spend $5 million on a promo.

00:00:32.083 --> 00:00:33.667
Frankly, I think this whole
thing is confusing.

00:00:34.583 --> 00:00:36.375
Do you guys have
any idea what a raven

00:00:36.458 --> 00:00:38.250
flying through the landscape
is supposed to look like?

00:00:38.291 --> 00:00:41.000
-What? No. Of course not.
-I've never seen a raven.

00:00:45.166 --> 00:00:46.375
You know what's gonna sell it?

00:00:47.208 --> 00:00:49.625
I should take my shirt
completely off and get
super greased up.

00:00:49.875 --> 00:00:52.667
-What does that have
to do with the videogame?
-That's not what he's saying.

00:00:51.792 --> 00:00:53.208
-Well, that'll sell the reality.
-What reality?

00:00:53.875 --> 00:00:55.083
Of a man on a bird?

00:00:55.458 --> 00:00:57.041
##

